#: ../../tools/pdbe_search_tools.rst:36 f3f988979aa546c59717a26ba199aa82
msgid ""
"``compound_id`` (string) (required) PDB ligand/compound 3-letter code. "
"Examples: 'ATP' (adenosine triphosphate), 'HEM' (heme), 'NAG' "
"(N-acetyl-D-glucosamine), 'FAD' (flavin adenine dinucleotide)."
msgstr ""

