#: ../../tools/pdbe_search_tools.rst:61 45a53e34ec3f4513aefbbc131c9460bf
msgid "**Name**: ``PDBeSearch_search_by_organism``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pdbe_search_tools.rst:63 3537dc8779f94f8780ef5f787d0da0b4
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search PDB structures filtered by organism through "
"PDBe's Solr search. Combines keyword search with organism name filtering."
" Useful for finding species-specific protein structures. Example: "
"searching for 'kinase' in 'Homo sapiens' returns human protein kinase "
"structures sorted by resolution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pdbe_search_tools.rst:67 d5013a61b154452ca979f870356beaac
msgid ""
"``organism`` (string) (required) Scientific name of organism. Examples: "
"'Homo sapiens', 'Escherichia coli', 'Mus musculus', 'Saccharomyces "
"cerevisiae'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pdbe_search_tools.rst:70 ccbf275adfb44b59bc18a82d5ad1aa9a
msgid ""
"``query`` (string, null) (optional) Optional keyword query to combine "
"with organism filter. Examples: 'kinase', 'receptor'. Default searches "
"all structures for the organism."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pdbe_search_tools.rst:73 ../../tools/pdbe_search_tools.rst:107
#: 4e91e28ad1d74c1f8c357fc1cfb0c7b1 cf1e9ad01c0a4cda838e4d56ed1d5492
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer, null) (optional) Maximum results to return (1-50, "
"default 10)."
msgstr ""

